# Backend base URL, inlined into the bundle AT BUILD TIME by Vite.
#
# Because it is inlined at build time, changing this value on Vercel does
# nothing until you redeploy. Set it, then trigger a new deployment.
#
# Local development can leave this unset; the app falls back to
# http://127.0.0.1:8000 (see frontend/src/config.ts).
#
# Deployed, set it to the Render service URL, with NO trailing slash:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://indu-api.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
